\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Heart with heart in love united,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In the heart of God seek rest.
\par Let your love be undivided,
\par For the Lord who hath us blessed.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He the head and we the members;
\par He the light and we the rays;
\par He the master, we the Brothers
\par We're each other's all our days.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Come, o come, ye Godly offspring,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And renew your covenant;
\par Pledge yourself for Christ an offspring,
\par In your heart His love implant.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par If this loving bond should ever
\par Lack I firmness, and in strength;
\par O then pray ye all together,
\par Pray till Jesus helps at length.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-360\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par    3. O Thou truest friend, united;
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  Make Thy consecrated Hand,
\par  Let their hearts be e'er delighted
\par to fulfill Thy  covenant;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  As Thou art with them united.
\par  Let them also ever be;
\par  Serve each other undivided,
\par  Knowing they are serving Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Jesus, Thou hast us commanded
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Practice love who bear Thy name;
\par Free them that by death hath banded,
\par Touch the slothful with Thy flame.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let the fire of love be kindled;
\par Grant each soul the light to see,
\par That we all are of one Father,
\par \pard      And united stand in Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

